 * @brief Helper to check and advance TLS handshake in event loop tick
 * 
 * Designed to be called from seve Activity tick handler.
 * Does ONE unit of work and returns immediately.
 * 
 * @param adapter The TLS handshake adapter
 * @param outComplete Set to true when handshake is finished (success or error)
 * @param outError Set to error code if handshake failed
